\item[S2] Dan Reznik, Ronaldo Garcia and Jair Koiller, \emph{Eighty New Invariants in the Elliptic Billiard}, arXiv:2004.12497v11 (29 October 2020), \S3.8 and Table 8, pp. 8--9. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2004.12497v11}.
